    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Hudson Properties proudly present this 3 bedroom end of terrace property to the market for sale. \n\nThis property comes to the market in good clean and tidy condition and has also been well maintained by its current owner. The property comprises of entrance hallway, kitchen/dining, living room, family bathroom and 3 good sized bedrooms. There is also a large block built shed to the rear of the property offering ample storage space and access to the back laneway and rear garden via same. \n\nHighfield Estate is ideally located within walking distance of all local amenities including primary and secondary schools, shops, bars, restaurants, leading supermarket chains, Whitewater Shopping Centre, Newbridge Silverware and much more. The town benefits from a regular train timetable and bus service. Access to the N7/M7 motorway is only a stones throw away making this property and ideal choice for any commuter. \n\nViewing is strictly by prior appointment with Agent only. \n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nEntrance Hallway: Wooden flooring, light fitting, under stairs storage, radiator \n\nKitchen/Dining: Tiled flooring, light fitting, area fully plumbed, fully fitted kitchen, tiled splash back area, oven, hob, extractor fan, stainless steel sink, worktop and storage, back door leading to rear garden\n\nLiving Room: Wooden flooring, light fitting, feature fireplace, radiator \n\nLanding: Carpet flooring, light fitting \n\nFamily Bathroom: Tiled floor to ceiling, electric shower, WHB, WC, radiator \n\nBedroom1: Wooden flooring, light fitting, radiator \n\nBedroom 2: Wooden flooring, light fitting, fully fitted wardrobe, radiator \n\nBedroom 3: Wooden flooring, light fitting, radiator \n\nFeatures:\n\nPVC hall door\nPVC double glazed windows\nSatellite TV\nBroadband/WiFi\nOutside security light\nBlock build shed to rear\nMains water\nMains sewage\nOil fired central heating\nBuilt in1950\nc.77.44sqmt\n\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\n\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. "
      },
